<title>USA: CalEnergy stake in Northern Electric rises.</title>
<headline>CalEnergy stake in Northern Electric rises.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CalEnergy Co Inc said Friday its ownership level reached 29.5 percent in connection with its proposed acquisition of Northern Electric plc.</p>
<p>Northern Electric is a regional electricity distribution and supply company in the United Kingdom in which CE Electric UK plc has purchased an additional 2.7 million shares. CE Electric is 70 percent owned by CalEnergy and 30 percent by Peter Kiewit Sons Inc.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
